    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Sofas and armchairs</td><td>Yes</td><td>Fire label intact, no major stains/damage</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Beds and mattresses</td><td>Sometimes</td><td>Must be clean and stain-free, fire label intact</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Wardrobes and drawers</td><td>Yes</td><td>Structurally sound, all parts present</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Tables and chairs</td><td>Yes</td><td>No major damage, stable</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Desks and bookcases</td><td>Yes</td><td>Good condition</td></tr>
      <tr><td>White goods</td><td>Some charities</td><td>Must be in working order</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

